<https://w3id.org/lmodel/iso42001/clause_10> dcterms:title "10" ;
	linkml:description "Getting better and putting things right." .
<https://w3id.org/lmodel/iso42001/clause_10_1> dcterms:title "10.1" ;
	linkml:description "Making the system better over time." .
<https://w3id.org/lmodel/iso42001/clause_10_2> dcterms:title "10.2" ;
	linkml:description "Dealing with an unmet requirement and removing its cause." .
<https://w3id.org/lmodel/iso42001/clause_4> dcterms:title "4" ;
	linkml:description "Why the system exists and what it reaches." .
<https://w3id.org/lmodel/iso42001/clause_4_1> dcterms:title "4.1" ;
	linkml:description "Matters inside and outside that bear on the system, climate among them, and the part the organization plays with AI." .
<https://w3id.org/lmodel/iso42001/clause_4_2> dcterms:title "4.2" ;
	linkml:description "Who has a stake in the system, and what they want from it." .
<https://w3id.org/lmodel/iso42001/clause_4_3> dcterms:title "4.3" ;
	linkml:description "Where the system stops, stated in writing." .
<https://w3id.org/lmodel/iso42001/clause_4_4> dcterms:title "4.4" ;
	linkml:description "Having the system and its processes in place, and keeping them up." .
<https://w3id.org/lmodel/iso42001/clause_5> dcterms:title "5" ;
	linkml:description "What top management must do." .
<https://w3id.org/lmodel/iso42001/clause_5_1> dcterms:title "5.1" ;
	linkml:description "How top management shows it leads and backs the system." .
<https://w3id.org/lmodel/iso42001/clause_5_2> dcterms:title "5.2" ;
	linkml:description "Management's written direction on AI." .
<https://w3id.org/lmodel/iso42001/clause_5_3> dcterms:title "5.3" ;
	linkml:description "Who holds which duty and power, including who checks conformity and who reports on performance." .
<https://w3id.org/lmodel/iso42001/clause_6> dcterms:title "6" ;
	linkml:description "Deciding what to do before doing it." .
<https://w3id.org/lmodel/iso42001/clause_6_1> dcterms:title "6.1" ;
	linkml:description "Dealing with what could go well or badly." .
<https://w3id.org/lmodel/iso42001/clause_6_1_1> dcterms:title "6.1.1" ;
	linkml:description "Criteria for risk, and the actions planned on risks and opportunities." .
<https://w3id.org/lmodel/iso42001/clause_6_1_2> dcterms:title "6.1.2" ;
	linkml:description "A repeatable way to find, analyse and rank AI risks." .
<https://w3id.org/lmodel/iso42001/clause_6_1_3> dcterms:title "6.1.3" ;
	linkml:description "Choosing treatments and controls, with the Statement of Applicability and the plan." .
<https://w3id.org/lmodel/iso42001/clause_6_1_4> dcterms:title "6.1.4" ;
	linkml:description "A way to work out what AI systems may do to people and society." .
<https://w3id.org/lmodel/iso42001/clause_6_2> dcterms:title "6.2" ;
	linkml:description "Measurable aims for AI, and how each will be reached." .
<https://w3id.org/lmodel/iso42001/clause_6_3> dcterms:title "6.3" ;
	linkml:description "Changing the system in an orderly way." .
<https://w3id.org/lmodel/iso42001/clause_7> dcterms:title "7" ;
	linkml:description "What the system needs in order to run." .
<https://w3id.org/lmodel/iso42001/clause_7_1> dcterms:title "7.1" ;
	linkml:description "Providing what the system needs." .
<https://w3id.org/lmodel/iso42001/clause_7_2> dcterms:title "7.2" ;
	linkml:description "People's ability to do the work, and the evidence of it." .
<https://w3id.org/lmodel/iso42001/clause_7_3> dcterms:title "7.3" ;
	linkml:description "What those who work for the organization must know." .
<https://w3id.org/lmodel/iso42001/clause_7_4> dcterms:title "7.4" ;
	linkml:description "Who is told what, when and how." .
<https://w3id.org/lmodel/iso42001/clause_7_5> dcterms:title "7.5" ;
	linkml:description "Keeping information under control." .
<https://w3id.org/lmodel/iso42001/clause_7_5_1> dcterms:title "7.5.1" ;
	linkml:description "Which information the system holds." .
<https://w3id.org/lmodel/iso42001/clause_7_5_2> dcterms:title "7.5.2" ;
	linkml:description "Naming, formatting, reviewing and approving it." .
<https://w3id.org/lmodel/iso42001/clause_7_5_3> dcterms:title "7.5.3" ;
	linkml:description "Keeping it to hand and protected." .
<https://w3id.org/lmodel/iso42001/clause_8> dcterms:title "8" ;
	linkml:description "Carrying out what was planned." .
<https://w3id.org/lmodel/iso42001/clause_8_1> dcterms:title "8.1" ;
	linkml:description "Running and controlling the processes, including those from outside." .
<https://w3id.org/lmodel/iso42001/clause_8_2> dcterms:title "8.2" ;
	linkml:description "Carrying out risk assessments, on schedule and when things change." .
<https://w3id.org/lmodel/iso42001/clause_8_3> dcterms:title "8.3" ;
	linkml:description "Carrying out the treatment plan and checking that it works." .
<https://w3id.org/lmodel/iso42001/clause_8_4> dcterms:title "8.4" ;
	linkml:description "Carrying out impact assessments, on schedule and when things change." .
<https://w3id.org/lmodel/iso42001/clause_9> dcterms:title "9" ;
	linkml:description "Checking how the system is doing." .
<https://w3id.org/lmodel/iso42001/clause_9_1> dcterms:title "9.1" ;
	linkml:description "What is measured, how and when, and what the results mean." .
<https://w3id.org/lmodel/iso42001/clause_9_2> dcterms:title "9.2" ;
	linkml:description "Audits the organization runs on itself." .
<https://w3id.org/lmodel/iso42001/clause_9_2_1> dcterms:title "9.2.1" ;
	linkml:description "What such an audit must establish, and how often." .
<https://w3id.org/lmodel/iso42001/clause_9_2_2> dcterms:title "9.2.2" ;
	linkml:description "The plan for those audits, and how impartial they are." .
<https://w3id.org/lmodel/iso42001/clause_9_3> dcterms:title "9.3" ;
	linkml:description "Top management's own look at the system." .
<https://w3id.org/lmodel/iso42001/clause_9_3_1> dcterms:title "9.3.1" ;
	linkml:description "How often it looks, and to what end." .
<https://w3id.org/lmodel/iso42001/clause_9_3_2> dcterms:title "9.3.2" ;
	linkml:description "What it must take in." .
<https://w3id.org/lmodel/iso42001/clause_9_3_3> dcterms:title "9.3.3" ;
	linkml:description "What it must produce." .
<https://w3id.org/lmodel/iso42001/cleaning> linkml:description "Mending wrong values and dealing with gaps." .
<https://w3id.org/lmodel/iso42001/complex_environment> linkml:annotations _:c14n97 ;
	linkml:description "A system works where situations vary widely, so its results are less sure." .
<https://w3id.org/lmodel/iso42001/continuous_validation> linkml:description "A system that goes on learning is checked again as it changes." .
<https://w3id.org/lmodel/iso42001/critical> linkml:description "Threatens the organization's objectives and needs action at once." .
<https://w3id.org/lmodel/iso42001/culture_and_values> linkml:annotations _:c14n482 ;
	linkml:description "What a society holds to, and the biases a system can feed." .
<https://w3id.org/lmodel/iso42001/curie> dcterms:conformsTo "https://www.w3.org/TR/curie/" ;
	a linkml:TypeDefinition ;
