lmodel/iso42001/AimsNonconformity> , <https://w3id.org/lmodel/iso42001/AimsObjective> , <https://w3id.org/lmodel/iso42001/AimsOperationalProcedure> , <https://w3id.org/lmodel/iso42001/AimsOrganization> , <https://w3id.org/lmodel/iso42001/AimsPlannedAction> , <https://w3id.org/lmodel/iso42001/AimsPolicy> , <https://w3id.org/lmodel/iso42001/AimsRecordMixin> , <https://w3id.org/lmodel/iso42001/AimsReportingObligation> , <https://w3id.org/lmodel/iso42001/AimsResource> , <https://w3id.org/lmodel/iso42001/AimsResponsibleUseProcess> , <https://w3id.org/lmodel/iso42001/AimsRisk> , <https://w3id.org/lmodel/iso42001/AimsRiskAssessment> , <https://w3id.org/lmodel/iso42001/AimsRiskAssessmentProcess> , <https://w3id.org/lmodel/iso42001/AimsRiskTreatmentPlan> , <https://w3id.org/lmodel/iso42001/AimsRiskTreatmentProcess> , <https://w3id.org/lmodel/iso42001/AimsRole> , <https://w3id.org/lmodel/iso42001/AimsStatementOfApplicability> , <https://w3id.org/lmodel/iso42001/AimsSupplierRelationship> , <https://w3id.org/lmodel/iso42001/AimsSystemEvent> , <https://w3id.org/lmodel/iso42001/AimsSystemResource> , <https://w3id.org/lmodel/iso42001/AimsTechnicalDocumentation> , <https://w3id.org/lmodel/iso42001/AimsThirdPartyRelationship> , <https://w3id.org/lmodel/iso42001/AimsToolingResource> , <https://w3id.org/lmodel/iso42001/AimsTopicSpecificPolicy> , <https://w3id.org/lmodel/iso42001/AimsUserInformation> ;
	linkml:default_prefix "iso42001" ;
	linkml:default_range <https://w3id.org/lmodel/iso42001/string> ;
	linkml:description "A LinkML model of the records an organization keeps to run an artificial intelligence (AI) management system under ISO/IEC 42001:2023. The records cover its context, leadership, planning and support, how it weighs and treats AI risks, and what its AI systems may do to people and society. They also cover those systems with their resources, data and documents, its audits and reviews, and what it corrects and improves. The reference controls of Annex A appear by number, with titles of this project's own." ;
