<https://w3id.org/lmodel/iso42001/labelling> linkml:description "Marking the values a model is to predict." .
<https://w3id.org/lmodel/iso42001/level_of_automation> linkml:annotations _:c14n138 ;
	linkml:description "How much a system does alone, which bears on safety or fairness among others." .
<https://w3id.org/lmodel/iso42001/life_cycle> linkml:annotations _:c14n76 ;
	linkml:description "Flaws anywhere in a system's life, from design to retirement." .
<https://w3id.org/lmodel/iso42001/likely> linkml:annotations _:c14n401 ;
	linkml:description "Will probably happen." .
<https://w3id.org/lmodel/iso42001/low> linkml:description "Managed by routine procedures." .
<https://w3id.org/lmodel/iso42001/machine_learning> linkml:annotations _:c14n598 ;
	linkml:description "The data a model learns from, or how it was gathered, is flawed." .
<https://w3id.org/lmodel/iso42001/maintainability> linkml:annotations _:c14n231 ;
	linkml:description "Defects can be mended and new needs met." .
<https://w3id.org/lmodel/iso42001/major> linkml:annotations _:c14n508 ;
	linkml:description "A serious effect on people, objectives or reputation." .
<https://w3id.org/lmodel/iso42001/major_nonconformity> linkml:description "A requirement not met in a way that puts the system's results in doubt." .
<https://w3id.org/lmodel/iso42001/medium> linkml:description "Needs management's attention and planned controls." .
<https://w3id.org/lmodel/iso42001/minor> linkml:annotations _:c14n579 ;
	linkml:description "An effect normal operations absorb." .
<https://w3id.org/lmodel/iso42001/minor_nonconformity> linkml:description "A requirement not met in an isolated way that leaves its results in reach." .
<https://w3id.org/lmodel/iso42001/model_inversion> linkml:description "Working back from a model to the data it learned from." .
<https://w3id.org/lmodel/iso42001/model_stealing> linkml:description "Copying a model by querying it or by taking it." .
<https://w3id.org/lmodel/iso42001/moderate> linkml:annotations _:c14n577 ;
	linkml:description "An effect that needs management to step in." .
<https://w3id.org/lmodel/iso42001/modify> skos:altLabel "mitigate" , "reduce" ;
	linkml:description "Change the risk with controls that lower its likelihood or its consequences." .
